{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "04R5", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(X, x)$", "MATH_0002": "$X$", "MATH_0003": "$x$", "MATH_0004": "$x$", "MATH_0005": "$X$", "MATH_0006": "$\\dim_x(X)$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:89395f1fa21f44f151cdbe2d37b39fc886e12238b3726fe309d78824b2ea17bb", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7cf7c2a06440e7dce75cbbad139ec69aec8cdbc520d16792207f874b8f988a71", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a germ of a scheme.\nThe dimension of <MATH_0002> at <MATH_0003> is the minimum of the dimensions of\nopen neighbourhoods of <MATH_0004> in <MATH_0005>, and any small enough open neighbourhood\nhas this dimension. Hence this is an invariant of the isomorphism class\nof the germ. We denote this simply <MATH_0006>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e8240a55c50a690f327272c52af7ec5b1c7bde946c3d0234b95e54d95bf66dac", "unit_id": "tag:04R5:prose-0004"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04R5", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$d \\in \\{0, 1, 2, \\ldots, \\infty\\}$", "MATH_0002": "$$\n\\mathcal{P}_d((X, x) \\to (S, s))\n\\Leftrightarrow\n\\dim_x (X_s) = d\n$$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-dimension-at-point}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:031fe407b739616619c248c939a97b24a812f89388e1128f36a3009d52352e21", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:73a0488f5c16d6eccc9160606a952f56dbe293f145f3f76461996636dba0d886", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001>.\nThe property of morphisms of germs\n<MATH_0002>\nis <ACCENT_0001>tale local on the source-and-target.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e30ba96afb384224aa2e9fa634398ae7d5bb9e4e8d157d680cfc0e6af2b1c4d1", "unit_id": "tag:04NL:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04R5", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$U'_{v'} \\to U_v$", "MATH_0002": "$u'$", "MATH_0003": "$u$", "MATH_0004": "$\\dim_u(U_v) = \\dim_{u'}(U'_{v'})$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{definition-local-source-target-at-point}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-etale-on-fiber}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-dimension-at-point-local}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:0ea035f3ac80e8fbedee897d9b11b0c803f3e80dc2b1c977e14a11397b0f85a5", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d227a0fcbbf49018c735f7be6777f7b1a29db491502b4a8129d7b9655f6778a9", "source_text": "Given a diagram as in\nDefinition <REF_0001>\nwe obtain an <ACCENT_0001>tale morphism of fibres\n<MATH_0001> mapping <MATH_0002> to <MATH_0003>, see\nLemma <REF_0002>.\nHence now the equality <MATH_0004> follows from\nLemma <REF_0003>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5888ef7ccf6f68e4b87e825b8e21a9cf6dec379ca7443bb119aa1d3701ddc348", "unit_id": "tag:04NL:proof"}
